    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psycho Pigs</strong> is a fast-paced party action game where crazy pigs battle it out using bombs! Get ready for a chaotic arena where the only goal is to blow up your opponents before they do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend on the same device: one player uses the keyboard, while the other plays with a controller, for explosive battles full of mayhem. Dodge, collect power-ups, and time your bomb throws perfectly to become the most dangerous pig in the arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master... Are you ready to unleash the chaos?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psycho Pigs</strong> is a fast-paced party action game where crazy pigs battle it out using bombs! Get ready for a chaotic arena where the only goal is to blow up your opponents before they do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend on the same device: one player uses the keyboard, while the other plays with a controller, for explosive battles full of mayhem. Dodge, collect power-ups, and time your bomb throws perfectly to become the most dangerous pig in the arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master... Are you ready to unleash the chaos?</p>",
    "short_description": "Who said pigs are peaceful? In Psyco Pig, forget mud and food\u2014it\u2019s all about bombs! Throw explosives, set traps, and cause farmyard mayhem. Play solo or challenge friends in wild local multiplayer battles. Explosions everywhere! Get ready to oink with chaos!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
